# The shared model for every build (DECISIONS.md 10 and 12).
# Create it once:  ollama create qwen3-agents -f contracts/ollama/Modelfile
# The settings live in the model so they apply on every API, including the OpenAI-style one CrewAI
# uses, which ignores a per-request num_ctx. Thinking cannot be set here; every build turns it off
# per request.
FROM qwen3:8b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER seed 42
